-- FANC 4-visit schedule question REMOVED (KRCHN): the old Kenya MOH 4-visit FANC model has been superseded by the WHO 2016 ANC guidelines recommending a minimum of 8 contacts, adopted in updated Kenya MOH ANC guidelines. Seeding this question risks teaching an outdated schedule as fact.
-- Q5 (KRCHN): 'A direct cause of maternal mortality include' deleted — all four options contained at least one indirect cause (anaemia, malaria, TB), making no option cleanly correct.
-- Q7 REMOVED (KRCHN): 'The obstretric conjugate measures' deleted — same reason as BScN version; answer 10cm vs 11cm creates ambiguity across Myles editions.
